{# Branded HTML email layout, same structure as the linx (SEAL ILL) emails:
   grey ground, one 600px white card, header bar with the logo, message,
   footer. Table-based with inline styles only, because that's what email
   programs (Outlook included) render reliably.

   Header matches the app: navy bar, white official logo, gold rule
   (style guide v3.0 allows the white logo "over a block of color"). The
   logo is embedded in the message as cid:argus-logo by MailService —
   argus.example.org only answers the office IP, so a hosted image would be
   broken on phones and at home. Previews can pass logo_src instead.

   WCAG: white on navy 8.9:1, ink on white 16:1, grey #5F5F5F on white
   6.4:1; gold is only ever a rule. Children set {% block subject %},
   {% block preheader %} (inbox preview line), {% block body %} (HTML, built
   with the mail/_macros helpers) and {% block plain %} (text part). #}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light only">
<title>{% block subject %}{% endblock %}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#F4F3F1;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:#F4F3F1;">{% block preheader %}{% endblock %}</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#F4F3F1;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E3E0DC;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#201E1D;">
        <tr>
          <td style="background:#1C4C7C;padding:24px;border-bottom:4px solid #B58358;">
            <img src="{{ logo_src|default('cid:argus-logo') }}" width="233" height="50"
                 alt="Argus"
                 style="display:block;border:0;height:50px;width:233px;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;">
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:10px 24px;background:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:1px solid #E3E0DC;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5F5F5F;">
            Expenditure &amp; Encumbrance Requests
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:24px;">
            {% if test_banner_to is defined %}
            {# Email test mode "redirect" (MailService): who would have received this. #}
            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 18px;">
              <tr><td style="border:2px solid #8D1A3D;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;color:#201E1D;">
                <strong style="color:#8D1A3D;">TEST MODE</strong> — this email would have gone to: {{ test_banner_to }}
              </td></tr>
            </table>
            {% endif %}
            {% block body %}{% endblock %}
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:14px 24px;border-top:1px solid #E3E0DC;background:#FAFAF9;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#5F5F5F;">
            Sent by the Expenditure &amp; Encumbrance Request System &middot; Southeastern NY Library Resources Council<br>
            21 S. Elting Corners Rd., Highland, NY 12528 &middot; <a href="https://www.senylrc.org" style="color:#1C4C7C;">senylrc.org</a>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
